==Trivia==
The names of this stage, and its sequel stage, [[Yellow Stone Volcano IV]], are potentially a reference to [[wikipedia:Yellowstone Caldera|Yellowstone Caldera]]: otherwise known as the Yellowstone Supervolcano. Situated beneath Yellowstone National Park in Wyoming, it is best known for its current status of dormancy despite its overwhelmingly destructive potential if it were to erupt today.

